      "@id": "ihh:ALB-F-0153",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "text": "After Saddam Hussein’s press referred to Madeleine Albright as an unparalleled serpent, she wore a golden snake brooch pinned to her suit for her next meeting on Iraq.",
