      "ihh:verifiedClaimSha256": "0df6916ce4992008e4b0d1a3b22758522af05d27ffc803130323cbb3c30a794e",
      "ihh:notes": "Round 9 (globe-to-map, 2026-10-29): the ship of her first crossing, from a record already on file (ALB-S-0154, NARA-held Biden White House remarks at her funeral, primary by the registry rule). Corroborates the ship in ALB-F-0185 (Bush Center, secondary, 'aboard the SS America in 1948'); no year or port is claimed. Port of departure not found in any registered source (searches round9-2026-10-29)."
    },
