      "ihh:reviewState": "edited",
      "ihh:review": {
        "ihh:state": "edited",
        "ihh:reviewer": "controller",
        "ihh:date": "2026-10-24",
        "ihh:note": "Frame 24 of roll WHPO-P02724 shows President Clinton with President Havel at the fireplace wall, not Albright: the committed examination of frames 08, 16 and 24 (review/decisions.jsonl, 2026-10-24, item ALB-M-0087 note) and the holder's own scope note for the roll, which names both meetings ('meeting with President Vaclav Havel of Czechoslovakia and others in the Oval Office of the White House'). The alt text now quotes the Havel half of that scope note. Rights unchanged: the roll-level owner ruling of 2026-10-24 (every frame inherits the roll's federal public-domain status) still holds. Codex re-review, Task 19 fix round 2.",
        "ihh:decision": "albright:decisions:3",
        "ihh:decisionDate": "2026-10-24"
      },
      "ihh:notes": "Ratio-lift RL-M-ALB-WHPO-P02724-24: one frame (3600 x 2439) of file unit WHPO-P02724 (ALB-M-0067 is the whole roll, disputed as not one image). Fireplace wall: mantel, painting, armchairs. Room labelled \"the Oval Office, April 1993\" (task 14b ruling). Chapter albright/secretary.\nEdited by controller on 2026-10-24 (G8): the alt text was 'President Clinton speaking with Ambassador to the United Nations Madeleine Albright and others in the Oval Office, April 20, 1993.'. Adversary verdict 'supported' by codex:gpt-6.1-sol (run adv-20261024T022453-1306, 2026-10-24) cleared for re-verification."
