        {
          "ihh:source": {
            "@id": "ihh:EIN-S-0013"
          },
          "ihh:quote": "With the rise of Adolf Hitler and Nazism, Einstein left Germany in 1932 to move to America where he took part in the Institute for Advanced Studies of Princeton.",
