          },
          "ihh:quote": "American Citizen\nTRENTON, N. J„ Oct. 1. (UP)—\nDr. Albert Einstein became a citizen\nof the United States today.\nWith 87 other aliens, representing\n12 nationalities, the famed mathe\nmatician and author of the theory\nof relativity, took the oath admin\nistered by Benjamin J. Havens, clerk\nof the federal district court, in the\npresence of Judge Phillip Forman.",
