      "ihh:notes": "Attribution fact for the direct quotes EIN-F-0082 and EIN-F-0083 (sentences of this letter). IAS says Einstein signed the letter; the FDR Library (NARA) post says it was drafted for Einstein's signature and dates it August 2, 1939. Authorship of the text is shared (LoC EIN-S-0068: drafted by Einstein and Leo Szilard), so captions should say 'signed'."
