        "ihh:rationale": "The snapshot describes an Alexander Sachs file but does not establish that its contents were written by Franklin D. Roosevelt or belong to Albert Einstein. Its “Unrestricted” status alone cannot establish public-domain rights for private writings, and the alt text adds identifiers absent from the holder’s record."
