      "description": "First 100 rows reviewed (NPG, NMAH, NPM, SIA, SIL). Leads not staged because their human-facing pages failed to snapshot: SIA siris_arc_393240 (1931 Caltech photo with Michelson and Millikan; siarchives.si.edu returned a Drupal database error in the browser and 403 to fetch); SIL manuscripts siris_sil_1100970 (letter dated 112 Mercer Street, Princeton, 23 February 1953), siris_sil_1100971 (Emergency Committee of Atomic Scientists letter, 29 April 1947), siris_sil_1100929 (postcard dated Berlin, 18 April 1915) - collections.si.edu and siris-libraries.si.edu showed a bot-verification page (not bypassed). NMAH items (Berks bust ca. 1954, 1970 Franklin Mint medal) carry no biographical content beyond the depiction and were dropped. Rejected namesakes: nmah_726329 (Albert Einstein Medical Center), AAA photo at Albert Einstein Medical College.; produced tmp-smithsonian-S-3, tmp-smithsonian-F-2, tmp-smithsonian-F-3, tmp-smithsonian-F-4, tmp-smithsonian-F-5 not merged (removed before the merge)"
    },
