          "ihh:quote": "Following her death in January 2000, she was cremated. Her ashes were brought to Vienna: a part was strewn in the woods of “Am Himmel” – a place their mother frequently visited as a child in Vienna’s 19th district – by her children Denise and Anthony Loder, and the rest were buried in a tomb of honor at the Vienna Central Cemetery.",
