      "description": "All 184 hits listed (limit=100, 2 pages; the proxy ignores rows= and returns 20, limit= works). Relevant: 335708097 naturalization petition (already LAM-S-0001), 167820368 patent case file, 36192, 38919, 110111, 563593, 148960657, 213259618. Photographs 350486745 (Truman Library, ca. 1940) and 178991813 (OWI Photographs of Wartime Personalities) left to the media family. 10569195 is the person authority already staged by identify. 74395327 'M-92 Hedwig Loder (Nee Lamarr)' (USACA property control, Austria) has no dates or other identifying text: not staged (namesake risk). 472569372 'Mandl, Fritz' (OMGUS external assets) has no Lamarr text in its description: not staged. LaMarr-Zweegman retake manifests are an unrelated surname. Most other hits (Morgenthau diaries, census schedules, morning reports, passenger manifests) match only on digitized full text not present in the description JSON, so nothing can be quoted.; produced tmp-nara-F-34, tmp-nara-F-35, tmp-nara-F-36 not merged (removed before the merge)"
